.TH SDL_GPUBufferRegion 3type "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 DATATYPES"
.SH NAME
SDL_GPUBufferRegion \- A structure specifying a region of a buffer.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_gpu.h>
.PP
.BI "typedef struct SDL_GPUBufferRegion
.BI "{
.BI "    SDL_GPUBuffer *buffer;  /**< The buffer. */
.BI "    Uint32 offset;          /**< The starting byte within the buffer. */
.BI "    Uint32 size;            /**< The size in bytes of the region. */
.BI "} SDL_GPUBufferRegion;
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Used when transferring data to or from buffers\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This struct is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR SDL_UploadToGPUBuffer (3),
.BR SDL_DownloadFromGPUBuffer (3)
